# TinyWorld environment
#
# TinyWorld is a static frontend with no secrets, no API keys and no backend.
# There is nothing you must set to run it locally.
#
# The only supported variable is the deployment base path, used when hosting
# under a sub-path such as GitHub Pages.

# Base path for the production build.
#   Vercel / custom domain root  ->  /            (the default, usually unset)
#   GitHub Pages sub-path        ->  /TinyWorld/   (match the repo name exactly)
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/